[3.565386, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.088241, "o", "Blueprint saas recorded in the contract of coupon.\r\nYour SaaS has 1 of 25 items.\r\nNext: Problem and audience written down (problem)\r\n  Without a named problem and person, every feature looks equally urgent.\r\n  Minimum: One paragraph: who has the problem, what it costs them today, how they solve it now.\r\n  Manual: the person confirms it with the line fm: approve planta/problem <how it was checked>\r\n· problem: Problem and audience written down\r\n✗ rules: Business rules written\r\n· pricing: Plans and prices\r\n✗ api: API separate from the screens\r\n✗ database: Database with migrations\r\n✗ auth: Accounts and sign-in\r\n✗ password-reset: Password recovery\r\n✗ tenants: Separation between customer companies (B2B)\r\n✗ states: Loading, empty and error states\r\n✗ billing: Billing\r\n✗ webhooks: Idempotent payment webhooks\r\n✗ renewal-refund: Renewal and refund\r\n✓ cents: Money in cents\r\n✗ types: Type checking\r\n✗ lint: Linter\r\n✗ tests: Tests of the business rules\r\n✗ ci: Continuous integration\r\n✗ secrets: Secrets out of the code\r\n✗ rate-limit: Request limits\r\n✗ privacy: Personal data: legal basis and deletion\r\n· backup: Tested backup\r\n✗ environments: Test and production environments\r\n· rollback: Deploy with a way back\r\n✗ logs: Logs and alerts\r\n✗ terms: Terms of use and privacy policy\r\n"]
